{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "05518d6b-ae1e-801f-9e9a-f1faf50d851f",
  "created_at": "2025-12-30T12:01:34-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Zoning and Inspections",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Bridget Brennan",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Anita Chaudhry",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T11:57:06-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zoning and Inspections, this is Anita. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T11:57:11-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, hello. Yes. Um, good morning. Well, it's just about noon now, isn't it. I'm calling about a fence. I manage a property, and I want to put one in, and I don't understand what I need to do first."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T11:57:25-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I can help with that. Which property is it? What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T11:57:30-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's one, five, one Ayrault Street. Up on the Hill. Historic Hill, they call it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T11:57:36-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 151 Ayrault. And what kind of fence are you thinking about?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T11:57:41-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A stockade fence. You know, the kind with the pickets close together, so you can't see through. It's right next to a busy road, and the noise and the headlights, it's, well, people want some privacy."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T11:57:54-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Is it wood, or something else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T11:57:58-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, I was going to say composite. Not real wood. Composite. The man at the store said it looks like wood but it doesn't rot. Is that, is that different? For the, for what you need?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T11:58:11-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Material usually isn't the main question. How tall are you planning?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T11:58:16-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four feet. Four. Not six. I thought four sounded smaller, so maybe it's easier. Is it easier?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T11:58:22-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Height does matter, yes, so that's good to know. Where on the lot would it go? Along the front, the side?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T11:58:30-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Along the side that faces the road. Oh, wait, I should say it, my real question. Do I need a permit for a fence? That's what I'm asking. Do I need one, yes or no?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T11:58:42-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "In general, yes, a fence usually does need a permit here. And since you're in the Historic Hill area, there may be an extra review on top of that, depending on how visible it is from the street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T11:58:55-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Extra review. Oh dear. What does that mean? Is that a second permit, or the same permit?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T11:59:01-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's usually part of the same application, just with another set of eyes on it. You'd submit a simple plan showing where the fence goes, the height, and the material. The office can tell you if the historic piece applies."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T11:59:15-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A plan. Like a drawing? I'm not an artist."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T11:59:19-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It can be very basic. A sketch of the property lines, the house, and a line where the fence goes, with measurements."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T11:59:27-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Measurements. I can do numbers. I do them slowly, but I do them right. So, and what's the fee? What does the permit cost?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T11:59:36-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The fee depends on the project, and I don't have the exact amount in front of me. It's listed on the permit application, or the office can quote it when you submit the plan."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T11:59:48-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh. So I can't just know it now. And is the fee for the permit the same as the, the review? Or two fees?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T11:59:57-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm not certain whether they're separate, so I'd rather you hear it from the permit desk. I can take your number and have someone call you back with that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T12:00:07-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. That would be good. My number is four, zero, one. [pause] Five, five, five. [pause] Zero, one, five, nine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T12:00:15-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me read that back. 401-555-0159. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T12:00:19-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. That's it. Oh, and the name, Bridget Brennan. B-R-E-N-N-A-N. Bridget with a D-G-E."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T12:00:25-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Bridget. And you're the property manager, not the owner, correct? They may ask whether the owner needs to sign."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T12:00:33-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I manage it. The owner doesn't live here. So he signs? Or I sign? I thought the permit was in the, the person who builds it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T12:00:43-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It could be either of you, or the contractor, depending on how it's set up. The desk will walk you through it when they call."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T12:00:52-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I'm still a little mixed up, but a call back will help. I wrote down four feet, composite, stockade, permit, maybe the historic review. Is that all?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T12:01:02-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's all of it. Also, if you have photos of the street side, that helps."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T12:01:08-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can take photos. Oh, and I have to tell you, I came downtown for this. I parallel parked on Broadway, right in one go. Between two cars. I'm pretty pleased about it, I don't do that often."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T12:01:21-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, good for you. Broadway can be tight."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T12:01:25-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It was. Thank you, Anita. I'll wait for the call."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T12:01:29-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Someone will be in touch. Have a good afternoon."
    }
  ],
